---
---
<div class="main">

  <div class="eyebrow reveal" style="--d: 80ms">Holding page · v0.1</div>

  <h1 class="h1 reveal" style="--d: 160ms">
    New portfolio<br />
    <span class="strike">coming</span> <span class="accent">brewing.</span>
  </h1>

  <p class="sub reveal" style="--d: 260ms">
    I'm <span class="name">Samuel Snopko</span> — Head of Product, founding employee of Storyblok,
    advisor to Clayhog and Nonverbia. In AI times the
    <span class="hl">bottleneck isn't the capability, it's adoption</span>
    — and that's the problem I want to spend the next chapter on.
  </p>
</div>

<style>
  .main {
    display: flex;
    flex-direction: column;
    justify-content: center;
    gap: 28px;
  }
  .eyebrow {
    font-family: var(--font-mono);
    font-size: 12px;
    letter-spacing: 0.1em;
    text-transform: uppercase;
    color: var(--color-firebrick);
    display: inline-flex;
    align-items: center;
    gap: 12px;
  }
  .eyebrow::before {
    content: "";
    width: 28px;
    height: 2px;
    background: var(--color-firebrick);
  }
  .h1 {
    font-family: var(--font-display);
    font-weight: var(--weight-black);
    font-size: clamp(48px, 6vw, 92px);
    line-height: 0.96;
    letter-spacing: -0.025em;
    color: var(--color-ink-900);
    text-wrap: balance;
  }
  .h1 .strike {
    color: var(--color-ink-300);
    text-decoration: line-through;
    text-decoration-thickness: 3px;
    text-decoration-color: var(--color-firebrick);
  }
  .h1 .accent { color: var(--color-firebrick); }
  .sub {
    font-family: var(--font-serif);
    font-size: 18px;
    line-height: 1.6;
    color: var(--color-ink-700);
    max-width: 58ch;
    letter-spacing: -0.005em;
  }
  .sub .name { font-weight: var(--weight-semibold); color: var(--color-ink-900); }
  .sub .hl {
    display: inline;
    position: relative;
    font-weight: var(--weight-semibold);
    color: var(--color-ink-900);
    background-image: linear-gradient(
      transparent 62%,
      rgba(178, 34, 34, 0.22) 62%,
      rgba(178, 34, 34, 0.22) 92%,
      transparent 92%
    );
  }
  @media (max-width: 640px) {
    .h1 { font-size: clamp(40px, 12vw, 60px); }
  }
</style>
